#: ../../source/docs/ros-install.rst:4 6b8759b5e39042e88244102c9aca497e
msgid "Installing ROS"
msgstr "安装 ROS"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-install.rst:6 92f134eb49784e4baeff9659320da3b7
msgid ""
"General instructions for `installing ROS can be found here "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/ROS/Installation>`__."
msgstr "`安装 ROS 的通用说明见此处 <http://wiki.ros.org/ROS/Installation>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-install.rst:8 8c2d089539024419b52204e41600de6d
msgid ""
"if installing on a desktop PC, install ROS Desktop-Full, on a companion "
"computer ROS-Base is enough"
msgstr "在台式电脑上安装时，请安装 ROS Desktop-Full；在伴飞计算机上安装 ROS-Base 即可"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-install.rst:9 5b983f3b6a114d479690f571667bc410
msgid "add ROS tool to your shell as stated in ROS wiki"
msgstr "按 ROS wiki 所述将 ROS 工具添加到 shell"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-install.rst:10 bf93f71c48cc46e98ec80376bf7ff31a
msgid "do not use root as the default user"
msgstr "不要使用 root 作为默认用户"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-install.rst:13 2752d59d211a470fa55a502633058130
msgid "Installing MAVROS"
msgstr "安装 MAVROS"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-install.rst:15 61f015fab7364bb7aeab55c8bf07cbdd
msgid ""
"MAVROS is compatible with all recent versions of ROS including Kinetic, "
"Melodic and Noetic."
msgstr "MAVROS 兼容所有近期版本的 ROS，包括 Kinetic、Melodic 和 Noetic。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-install.rst:17 fe6b3cef7e204d089ed70a21b7d0331f
msgid ""
"Instructions for `installing MAVROS can be found here "
"<https://github.com/mavlink/mavros/tree/master/mavros#installation>`__ but "
"in short involve running the following command."
msgstr ""
"`安装 MAVROS 的说明见此处 "
"<https://github.com/mavlink/mavros/tree/master/mavros#installation>`__，简而言之是运行以下命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-install.rst:26 5dd3f857d00c4c3ca6034a3b95e1c439
msgid "For ease of use on a desktop computer, please also install RQT"
msgstr "为便于在台式电脑上使用，请同时安装 RQT"
